- OK, getting eBay.

00:35:23.290 --> 00:35:23.920
Got it.

00:35:23.920 --> 00:35:25.450
Looking for a
color that's black,

00:35:25.450 --> 00:35:27.090
brown, or something else?

00:35:27.090 --> 00:35:28.080
- Black.

00:35:28.080 --> 00:35:28.740
- Great.

00:35:28.740 --> 00:35:31.130
Do you want a style that's
shoulder bag, messenger

00:35:31.130 --> 00:35:32.960
and cross-body,
or something else?

00:35:32.960 --> 00:35:34.010
- Shoulder bag.

00:35:34.010 --> 00:35:35.930
- I looked through
seven options on eBay,

00:35:35.930 --> 00:35:39.270
and the best deal
on this item is $95.

00:35:39.270 --> 00:35:41.520
I have more info on
